(meta task-theme-remove-cmd
  (description "Implement `zetl theme remove <name>` per REQ-014-013.

Add to ThemeCommand enum:
```rust
/// Remove an installed theme
Remove {
    /// Theme name to remove
    name: String,
},
```

Implementation:
1. Validate the name (no path traversal).
2. Check if name is a bundled-only theme (no .zetl/themes/<name>/ on disk). If so, error: 'cannot remove bundled theme'.
3. If theme shadows a bundled theme, warn: 'removing installed version; bundled version will become active'.
4. Delete .zetl/themes/<name>/ recursively.
5. Output JSON: { removed: { name, was_shadowing: bool } }.

REQ-014-013.")
  (acceptance "zetl theme remove deletes installed theme; refuses to remove bundled-only themes; warns when removing shadow of bundled theme; JSON output; path traversal rejected"))

